id1 twice -> first only
```

### Что проверить
Запусти проверку и отдельно проверь граничный случай из условия.$m3_l30_t5_stmt$, $m3_l30_t5_starter$def dedupe_udp_packets(packets):
    pass
$m3_l30_t5_starter$, $m3_l30_t5_solution$def dedupe_udp_packets(packets):
    seen = set()
    result = []
    for packet in packets:
        packet_id = packet['id']
        if packet_id not in seen:
            seen.add(packet_id)
            result.append(packet)
    return result
